sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Frontend as Frontend UI (Next.js)
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend (/api/v1)
    participant Judge0 as Judge0 CE Sandbox
    participant DB as Relational DB (dev.db / Postgres)
    participant RAG as Vector Store (pgvector / HNSW)
    participant Analytics as Analytics Engine

    Student->>Frontend: Completes Assessment / Practice Session
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/submissions or /tests/.../submit
    
    alt Code Submission
        Backend->>Judge0: Dispatch sandboxed code execution
        Judge0-->>Backend: Verdict (Accepted / WA / TLE) & execution time
    end

    Backend->>DB: INSERT / UPDATE submissions & verdicts
    
    Note over Backend, DB: --- Step 1: Mastery State Update ---
    Backend->>Backend: Calculate Bayesian/Elo Mastery Delta (app/services/mastery.py)
    Backend->>DB: UPSERT INTO mastery (score, accuracy, attempt_count, avg_time)
    
    Note over Backend, DB: --- Step 2: Company Readiness Re-computation ---
    Backend->>Backend: Evaluate Equation 3.1 Components (app/services/readiness_data.py)
    Backend->>DB: INSERT INTO readiness_scores (overall, components, weights, computed_at)
    
    Note over Backend, DB: --- Step 3: Adaptive Roadmap Revision Trigger ---
    opt If Score < 50% on Topic
        Backend->>Backend: Recommendation Agent triggered (orchestrator.py)
        Backend->>DB: UPDATE roadmaps (increment version, insert remedial schedule)
        Backend->>DB: INSERT INTO recommendations
    end

    Note over Frontend, Analytics: --- Step 4: Dashboard & Analytics Refresh ---
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/v1/me/analytics?days=30
    Backend->>DB: Query historical attempts, readiness trends, mastery nodes
    Backend-->>Frontend: Analytics payload (Accuracy over time, Readiness trends)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Re-render Recharts visualizations & Progress bars
